    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d401-a1">

                <pb facs="0388" n="368" sameAs="frus:frus1864p3/pg368"/>

                <head>A.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Consulate of Sweden and Norway</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Shanghai,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-12-04"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 4, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your excellency’s letter of November 7, and to thank you for your very
                    successful effort to procure from the Chinese high authorities the recognition
                    of my official position under the treaty with Sweden, negotiated at Canton in,
                    1847.</p>
                <p>I shall report to the government at Stockholm the very kind assistance you have
                    rendered, as evincing the friendly feeling entertained by you towards Swedish
                    interests in China.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>EDWARD CUNNINGHAM, <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Consul
                        General.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Anson Burlingame,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
